From time to time, we observe the following ERROR message during streams close:
{code:java}
2024-04-13 07:40:16,222 INFO o.a.k.s.KafkaStreams [32] stream-client [testapp-83aa0e09-a6ef-45e4-9393-69dfba4928bf] State transition from RUNNING to PENDING_SHUTDOWN
