{code}
These ERRORs started showing up when we moved from 2.7.2 to 3.3.2 and we have not changed any code related to streams shutdown.



When the problem does not occur (most of the time), it looks like the following:
{code:java}
2024-04-13 07:40:11,333 INFO o.a.k.s.KafkaStreams [55] stream-client [testapp-e2212b31-e9c2-4c75-92f6-1e557e27bf66] State transition from RUNNING to PENDING_SHUTDOWN
2024-04-13 07:40:11,341 INFO o.a.k.s.KafkaStreams [32] stream-client [testapp-e2212b31-e9c2-4c75-92f6-1e557e27bf66] Streams client is in PENDING_SHUTDOWN, all resources are being closed and the client will be stopped. {code}

