description:
The {{CoordinatorRequestManager.markCoordinatorUnknown()}} method logs a warning for the user when the client is not able to connect with the coordinator for more than a minute:

{quote}Consumer has been disconnected from the group coordinator for Xms{quote}
 
However, if the consumer logic invokes {{markCoordinatorUnknown()}} before a connection was ever established, a bug in the logic causes the misleading output of a log message such as:
 
{quote}Consumer has been disconnected from the group coordinator for 1733769862524ms{quote}

